# Daedalus project memory (local, not shared)
.daedalus/

# Daedalus: commit the gameplan and workstream plans; everything else in .daedalus/ (including
# pending proposals) stays local (edicts 0007, 0008)
!.daedalus/
.daedalus/*
!.daedalus/roadmap/
.daedalus/roadmap/*
!.daedalus/roadmap/gameplan.json
!.daedalus/roadmap/index.json
!.daedalus/gameplans/
.daedalus/gameplans/*.pending.json

# Daedalus: the palace's dispatch rules are shared with the team (issue #47)
!.daedalus/dispatch.json
